# Responsive UI

All UI must work on **phone first**, then scale up for tablet and desktop.

## Layout

- Authenticated pages use `AppShell` (mobile hamburger nav, desktop sidebar at `lg:`)
- Page titles use `PageHeader` from `components/layout/AppShell.tsx`
- Max content width: `max-w-7xl`; padding: `px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-6 lg:py-8`

## Breakpoints

| Prefix | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| default | Single column, stacked forms, full-width buttons |
| `sm:` (640px) | 2-column grids, inline buttons, show email in header |
| `md:` (768px) | 2-column forms, show data tables |
| `lg:` (1024px) | Sidebar nav, hide mobile menu |

## Data lists

- **Mobile (`< md`):** `MobileCardList` + `MobileCard` — never horizontal-scroll tables
- **Desktop (`≥ md`):** `DesktopTable` with `<table>`
- Always implement both views for list/table pages

## Touch & typography

- Buttons: `min-h-10` on mobile, `py-2.5`; full-width CTAs use `w-full sm:w-auto`
- Inputs/selects: `py-2.5 text-base sm:text-sm` (prevents iOS zoom)
- Cards: `p-4 sm:p-6`
- Headings: `text-xl sm:text-2xl` for page titles; `text-2xl sm:text-3xl` for stat numbers

## Colors & components

- **Palette:** pasture green (`pasture-*`) primary, barn amber (`barn-*`) accent, warm cream (`field`) backgrounds, soil brown (`soil-*`) text
- **Typography:** `font-display` (Bitter serif) for headings/brand, Source Sans 3 for body
- **Brand:** use `Logo` component; background uses `field-pattern` class
- Use existing UI: `Button`, `Input`, `Select`, `Card`, `StatCard`, `ActionLink` — do not add CSS frameworks
- Tailwind v4 via `@import "tailwindcss"` + `@theme` in `index.css`

## Example pattern

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — responsive list page
<PageHeader title="Users" description="..." />
<MobileCardList>{items.map(...)}</MobileCardList>
<DesktopTable><thead>...</thead><tbody>...</tbody></DesktopTable>

// ❌ BAD — table only, breaks on mobile
<table className="w-full">...</table>
```
